
---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Esse yuborish"
  description="Esse va ijodiy ishlaringizni Foydali Blog saytiga yuboring."
>
  <section class="container" style="max-width: 760px; padding-top: 48px; padding-bottom: 64px;">
    <p style="color: #166534; font-weight: 600;">IJODIY MAYDON</p>

    <h1>Essengizni biz bilan ulashing</h1>

    <p style="line-height: 1.8; color: #526157;">
      O‘z fikrlaringiz, hayotiy kuzatuvlaringiz va ijodiy ishlaringizni yuboring.
      Har bir esse tahririyat tomonidan ko‘rib chiqiladi. Faqat ma’qullangan
      esselar saytda e’lon qilinadi.
    </p>

    <form
      action="https://docs.google.com/forms/"
      method="get"
      style="display: grid; gap: 18px; margin-top: 32px;"
    >
      <label>
        Ism va familiyangiz
        <input
          type="text"
          name="author"
          required
          placeholder="Ism va familiyangizni kiriting"
          style="display: block; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 8px; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #d5ded7; border-radius: 8px;"
        />
      </label>

      <label>
        Elektron pochtangiz
        <input
          type="email"
          name="email"
          required
          placeholder="example@gmail.com"
          style="display: block; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 8px; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #d5ded7; border-radius: 8px;"
        />
      </label>

      <label>
        Esse sarlavhasi
        <input
          type="text"
          name="title"
          required
          placeholder="Essengizga sarlavha bering"
          style="display: block; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 8px; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #d5ded7; border-radius: 8px;"
        />
      </label>

      <label>
        Esse matni
        <textarea
          name="essay"
          required
          rows="12"
          placeholder="Essengiz matnini shu yerga yozing..."
          style="display: block; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 8px; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #d5ded7; border-radius: 8px; font: inherit;"
        ></textarea>
      </label>

      <label style="display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start; line-height: 1.6;">
        <input type="checkbox" name="consent" required />
        <span>Esseni ko‘rib chiqish va ma’qullangan taqdirda saytda e’lon qilish uchun yuborishga roziman.</span>
      </label>

      <button
        type="submit"
        style="padding: 14px 20px; border: 0; border-radius: 8px; background: #14532d; color: white; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;"
      >
        Esseni yuborish
      </button>
    </form>

    <p style="margin-top: 20px; color: #69766d; font-size: 14px;">
      Eslatma: esse avval tahririyat tomonidan tekshiriladi.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
